nswer-field/correct "answer-98f236ac-105f-5734-a2ee-f784b9f39e96" :answer-field/choices ["answer-98f236ac-105f-5734-a2ee-f784b9f39e96"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "answer-98f236ac-105f-5734-a2ee-f784b9f39e96" :answer/id #uuid "98f236ac-105f-5734-a2ee-f784b9f39e96" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-12" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "question-ae461202-cffe-5f3e-9a80-3b16cb6085db" :question/id #uuid "ae461202-cffe-5f3e-9a80-3b16cb6085db" :question/math-academy-id "q-235650" :question/problem "$-75-15=${{field-1}}" :question/worked-solution "The answer will be negative since $-75$ is negative, and we're subtracting $15$ from it.\n\nWe start by solving an easier problem:\n\n$$\n75+15\n$$\n\nNext, we carry out the addition:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned} &  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\text{ }1\\,\\,\\,\\, &  \\\\  &  & \\,\\,\\,\\,7\\,\\,\\,\\, & \\,\\,\\,\\,5\\,\\,\\,\\, \\\\ \\,\\,\\,\\,+\\,\\,\\,\\, &  & \\,\\,\\,\\,1\\,\\,\\,\\, & \\,\\,\\,\\,5\\,\\,\\,\\, \\\\  &  & \\,\\,\\,\\,9\\,\\,\\,\\, & \\,\\,\\,\\,0\\,\\,\\,\\,\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSo, we have \n\n$$\n75+15=90.\n$$\n\nHowever, since our answer must be negative, we need to change the sign of the answer above. \n\nTherefore, we conclude that\n\n$$\n-75-15=-90.\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["answer-field-e799cd9c-96b9-50c9-b8ea-bcd6397e022b"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "answer-field-e799cd9c-96b9-50c9-b8ea-bcd6397e022b" :answer-field/id #uuid "e799cd9c-96b9-50c9-b8ea-bcd6397e022b" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank :answer-field/correct "answer-2d373559-bd4e-5999-92de-d4471f4fc2c1" :answer-field/choices ["answer-2d373559-bd4e-5999-92de-d4471f4fc2c1"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "answer-2d373559-bd4e-5999-92de-d4471f4fc2c1" :answer/id #uuid "2d373559-bd4e-5999-92de-d4471f4fc2c1" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-90" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "question-4d